  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Wearable & Wireless Pumps",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObWZ2t/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Wearable & Wireless Pumps | Momcozy® Official Site – CA | How Much Milk Am I Supposed to | Pumping Enough? Find Out Here | Milk Boost Mode Built In | Is Your Pump Output Normal? | Power Pumping Explained | Expert Tips to Pump More | Pumping Output by Baby's Age | Easy to Use | Momcozy | {keyword:top rated breast pump} | Trusted by 5M+ moms | Shop Momcozy Canada today | Wondering if you're pumping enough? Get output charts by baby's age + tips to boost supply | Low output? Learn the common causes — pump fit, settings & schedule | Pumping Output Charts, 20-Minute Averages & Proven Tips to Increase Your Milk Supply | ower pumping, warm compress & schedule tips to increase your milk.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObWZ2t/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ 静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化 ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除 ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObWZ2t/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M03 未标注来源的效果数据声明；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）；U03 涉及医院/NICU 场景，需核实临床适用性声明；M02 吸力夸大用语（建议改为客观档位描述）；M05 等级背书用语（需核实是否有对应认证）",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObWZ2t/命中原因"
  },
